{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119","id":4359153981,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7XJ4KE","number":119119,"title":"Allow building Web platform with C#/.NET module enabled","user":{"login":"AndresFpdhi","id":135043859,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAybEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135043859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresFpdhi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:05:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T16:43:26Z","closed_at":"2026-04-30T16:43:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nDeclares the Web platform as supporting the `mono` module so that\r\n`scons platform=web module_mono_enabled=yes` no longer aborts in\r\n`modules/mono/config.py` before any C++ compiles.\r\n\r\nThis is a **build-system unblock only**. C#/.NET exports to Web are\r\nstill gated at the editor level — the runtime hosting, exporter\r\nchanges, and template variants required for functional C# web exports\r\nare not part of this PR. The export-time error message is updated to\r\nreflect that support is in development rather than directing users\r\nback to Godot 3.\r\n\r\nThis is intended as a small, low-risk first step that unblocks\r\nparallel work on the runtime side without committing to any specific\r\nruntime-hosting design.\r\n\r\nRefs #70796\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- `platform/web/detect.py`: add `\"supported\": [\"mono\"]` to `get_flags()`\r\n  (mirrors the pattern used by Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, Linux).\r\n- `modules/mono/build_scripts/mono_configure.py`: remove four\r\n  commented-out platform-detection lines that have been dead since the\r\n  .NET rewrite.\r\n- `platform/web/export/export_plugin.cpp`: replace the \"Use Godot 3\"\r\n  message with copy that signals work-in-progress.\r\n\r\n## What this enables\r\n\r\n- `scons platform=web target=template_{debug,release} module_mono_enabled=yes`\r\n  succeeds.\r\n- Non-C# Web exports are unaffected (the .NET runtime is never\r\n  initialized in non-editor builds without the `dotnet` feature).\r\n- Editor builds for Web remain rejected as before\r\n  (`module_supports_tools_on(env[\"platform\"])` still returns false).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":6,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}